Board and schematic view layer setup without a wx panel (ROADMAP P1-3).

PCB_DRAW_PANEL_GAL and SCH_DRAW_PANEL keep their views' layer order, targets
and dependencies in member functions. This moves the bodies into free
functions taking a KIGFX::VIEW (the members now call them), so Triage's
headless engine sets up its views exactly as KiCad's editors do.

